      R. Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَلَثْلَثَ بِالمَكَانِ</span></b>  <i>He became withholden</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَبَّسَ</span>) <i>in the place, and tarried,</i> or <i>remained, in it.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَلَثْلَثَ فِى أَمْرِهِ</span> <i>He was
